# 針對你的專案路徑（My project/）進行通用匹配
**/[Ll]ibrary/
**/[Tt]emp/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Bb]uild/
**/[Bb]uilds/
**/[Ll]ogs/
**/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/

# 保留原本的萬用字元規則
.utmp/
*.log
.vs/
.gradle/
ExportedObj/
.consulo/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# 忽略 Unity 產生的中繼檔案與崩潰報告
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta
sysinfo.txt

# 忽略大型編譯產出
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app

# 忽略 Addressables 與 Android 暫存
**/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*
